description	"SpecForce Marine

Battle-hardened Rebels sporting low-gravity suits and intimidating weapons.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Frag Grenade (1)
- Det Pack (1)
-- 100% more Dmg

^5Powers:
- Moonshoes (Jump 3)

^6Inventory:
- Stimpak ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (1)
- Getup (1)
- 25% more Kb Taken
- Resource Regen: 25/.5s
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Slow Faller
- Dexterity (3)
- Flipkick (1)
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (3)
- Environmental Protection (1)"